<Base title="Website Services" description="Design and build for businesses that want a website they can use, edit and grow — custom design on the platforms the world already uses. In plain Engl">
<section><div class="container">
<p class="breadcrumb"><a href={BASE + "/services"}>Services</a> / Website Services</p>
<p class="eyebrow">Services · Website Services</p>
<h1>Website Services</h1>
<p class="lead">Design and build for businesses that want a website they can use, edit and grow — custom design on the platforms the world already uses. In plain English: we make your website. Technically: custom design and UX on WordPress (38.6% of the web), Shopify, Wix or Squarespace, plus no-code apps.</p>
<p style="max-width:760px"><strong>What am I selling here?</strong> If you need a website, a store or an app, start here. If you already have a website and it needs hosting that works, start with Managed Hosting. If you need cloud, compliance or talent, start with Professional Services.</p>
<div class="grid3"><div class="card silo"><h3>Web Design</h3><p class="plain">A custom website that sells while you sleep.</p><p class="tech">Your website is the first thing most customers see, and the first thing they judge you by.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/web-design"}>Explore Web Design →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>UX Design</h3><p class="plain">Websites people remember — and use.</p><p class="tech">UX design is the work that happens before the visuals: who your visitors are, what they are trying to do, and where your current site loses them.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/ux-design"}>Explore UX Design →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Website Builder</h3><p class="plain">Your site, editable by you.</p><p class="tech">Not every business needs a fully custom website.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/website-builder"}>Explore Website Builder →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>No-Code App Builder</h3><p class="plain">An app for your business, without the code.</p><p class="tech">In plain English: an app your customers can download from the App Store and Google Play, built without writing code from scratch.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/no-code-app-builder"}>Explore No-Code App Builder →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>eCommerce Setup</h3><p class="plain">A store that sells, day and night.</p><p class="tech">An online store is not a website with a buy button.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/ecommerce"}>Explore eCommerce Setup →</a></div></div>
<h2 style="margin-top:40px">How to choose</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">Start with the service that matches your problem, not with the whole list. Every service below has its own page — what it is, who it is for, what you get, how it works, what it costs, and the questions people ask before they buy. If you are not sure which one, book a strategy call and we will point you to the right one before you commit to anything.</p>
<h2 style="margin-top:40px">What it costs</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">Every project is quoted, and we scope before we quote. Tell us your budget and we tell you what fits, in writing, before you commit. No fixed price list, no hidden fees.</p>
<h2 style="margin-top:40px">Before you ask</h2>
<div class="faq"><details><summary>Do I need a custom website or a builder site?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">A builder site is faster and cheaper, and easier to edit. A custom site is more flexible. For most small businesses, a builder site is the right start — and we will tell you if it is not.</p></details>
<details><summary>Who owns the site?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">You do. Domain, website, content and data are in your accounts, in your name. No lock-in.</p></details>
<details><summary>How long does a website take?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">Most websites take 4–6 weeks from first call to launch. A focused build with ready content takes about 3 weeks.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you rebuild my existing site?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">Yes. We redesign it and redirect the old pages, so you keep your search rankings.</p></details></div>
<p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href={BASE + "/contact"}>Book a strategy call →</a></p>
</div></section>
</Base>
